Package: kalinka-server-libs
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: armhf
Maintainer: Dmitry Savin <envelsavinds@gmail.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Kalinka-Player/KalinkaPlayer
Depends: libopenblas0, libjpeg62-turbo, libopenjp2-7, libtiff6, libxcb1, libwebp7, libwebpmux3, libwebpdemux2
Description: system libraries the Kalinka server's Python packages need on 32-bit ARM
 On 32-bit ARM the server's Python packages come from piwheels, whose wheels
 link against system libraries where PyPI's bundle their own: numpy against
 OpenBLAS, and Pillow against the JPEG, JPEG 2000, TIFF, XCB and WebP ones.
 The server cannot start without them. This package has no files of its own.
